            "paragraphs": [
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "How to read this report",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI Semibold",
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#0F172A"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The model ranks people only a little better than chance (C-index 0.60). Its 12-month error is about 1.7% lower than giving everyone the same 14% risk.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#0F172A"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "So the decision is driven by the assumptions. Targeting beats both 'nobody' and 'everybody' only when the threshold c ÷ (e·k) lands near the 14% base rate, and the best gain is 4.3% of one salary per employee.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#0F172A"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The number most worth measuring is e, the intervention's effectiveness, with a randomised pilot (about 600 people per arm to detect 20% → 14%).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#0F172A"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Caveats: a self-selected survey, not one company · personality was measured at survey time · associations, not causes · data CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, © Edward Babushkin.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#64748B"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
